  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">MTDP IV BASELINE REPORT</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">&lt;p class=&quot;ql-align-justify&quot;&gt;This initiative aims at supporting the design and development of the&lt;strong&gt; SRBC programme. &lt;/strong&gt;This entails a) analysing the MTDP III review, b) providing an assessment of the relevance and credibility of MTDP IV, including its financing, and c) showing the links between MTDP IV and the three sub sectoral strategies that are of interest for this SRBC (i.e. FCCB; WASH; Governance) , with baseline data and identifying eventual Monitoring and reporting system in place.&lt;/p&gt;</narrative>
  </description>
